message: "If you use this software, please cite this release and the associated manuscript."
title: "T1D-CVD risk calculators: reproducible agreement analysis and open comparison tool"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Liegertová"
    given-names: "Michaela"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-10
repository-code: "https://github.com/MichaLie/t1d-cvd-risk-calculators"
url: "https://michalie.github.io/t1d-cvd-risk-calculators/metatool/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - type 1 diabetes
  - cardiovascular risk
  - risk calculators
  - reproducible research
  - synthetic cohort
abstract: >-
  Reproducible implementations and an exploratory agreement analysis of cardiovascular-risk
  calculators relevant to type 1 diabetes, with a transparent browser comparison tool. No
  individual-patient data or outcomes are used, and the software is not a clinically validated
  prediction model.
